{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/254448-how-does-your-garden-grow","id":254448,"title":"How does your garden grow?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-11T11:20:00-07:00","id":254448,"title":"How does your garden grow?","content":"I noticed a distinct lack of love for cryptoflora and wanted to see if anyone has used cryptoflora for their game yet and set a place to share to some ideas.<br /> <br /> My first idea was a bush covered in small mechanical berries with small tubes full of oil that when eaten would give aether depending on how many were eaten","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T12:07:14-07:00","id":254507,"title":"","content":"The fungi growing on the sarcophagus walls at Chernobyl gives me ideas","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/991-pgolasze13","name":"pgolasze13","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T12:51:02-07:00","id":254538,"title":"","content":"As a lover of plants yes please share your ideas. Though I feel for your berries they should have location restrictions and slowly drain residual aether (good way to stay off the radar potentially)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T13:17:53-07:00","id":254553,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\">I've been keeping a list of random cryptid ideas so here are some plant ones.</span> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fruit trees that give people temporary powers when eaten</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Venus fly trap like plant that replaces people eaten with pod people.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Grass which gives off minor aether signature. not enough to harvest but pings aetheric resonance possibly concealing aether sources nearby. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Plants that generate aether but poison area killing other plants and possibly people</span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/92-ramza","name":"Ramza","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar92_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T13:37:50-07:00","id":254577,"title":"","content":"A fruit that when eaten will allow a human to access the same quantum state demons use to lie","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T03:10:56-07:00","id":255153,"title":"","content":"I'm now picturing a demon with a near field effect hellhound gardening tool that allows them to create his own Audrey 2. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> There is a book i heard of that had beings with fungus based technology including the fungal equivalent of cyborgs. So think of fungal parasite turned into fungal symbiote and have fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 09-12-2014, 06:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T07:45:50-07:00","id":256035,"title":"","content":"fruits which bootstrap certain emotions depending on appearance for when you just cant fail your roll or if a friend is about to taught something and you don't want him to flip out or maybe you do","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3839-crytofloragardener","name":"CrytofloraGardener","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T12:13:59-07:00","id":256191,"title":"","content":"---You Are What You Eat---<br /> <br /> <u><b>Plot</b></u>: A struggling local community, much to their delight, cannot figure out why all their trees and flowers are growing at such a high rate.<br /> Flowers bloom early (sometimes in winter) and look much larger and with colors much more vivid.<br /> Fruit trees give 7-10 times the amount of fruit, and the fruit's taste is sweet and delicious, but strangely enough, they contain no seeds or pits.<br /> When examining the root structure, scientists find curious patterns and shapes -- almost like a circuit diagram.<br /> <br /> These flora changes have resulted in a much needed boost of tourism to the town (whose former glory as a Route 66 stop is nothing but a ghost). Local businesses are 'sprouting' up to accommodate the influx of people wanting to see the &quot;New Garden of Eden&quot;<br /> <br /> <u><b>Reality</b></u>: a new flower, planted by an angel produces a type of pollen that, when pollinated, changes the bee to be a crypto. The bee then goes onto 'pollinate' other plants and so on. It's curious that the bees and pollen will revert back to normal if taken outside the town.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Questions</b></u>: No one knows what the God-Machine's plan is for this is, and it's up to the Demons to find out. If the plan is harmful, can they sacrifice dying town's 'last chance at renewal'? Without the local tourism and growing agro-business, the town will surely fail and go back to it's pattern of depression and alcoholism.<br /> <br /> And what happens to the people that eat these cryptofruits and cryptoveggies? Are they affected? Can they be saved? Do they have to be routed out and 'pulled like weeds in a garden'?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3854,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","user":"darthcoffee","date":". 09-13-2014, 03:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","name":"darthcoffee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T22:33:40-07:00","id":256527,"title":"","content":"What would happen to a tree spirit that was bound to a tress as it was exposed and became crypto flora? What if they became like a dryad?<br /> <br /> -A humanoid form can pull itself out of a specific tree and re enter this same tree<br /> <br /> -it requires aether now not essence to manifest in such a way. In the tree it accumulates aether from the resonant aether from 1/month, 1/week, 1/day based on location and because it requires aether(1) to manifest like any other crypto it can detect aether and is drawn to feed off of it.<br /> <br /> -give it a few appropriate numen to make it have some claws<br /> <br /> ....but then what about the tree?<br /> <br /> The tree itself is a specific breed of oak mentioned in passing (is mentioned in passing by DtD). The wood of this tree blocks aether detection.... a rarity for a reason.<br /> <br /> edit: breed not bread -.-","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2909,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","user":"Mr.F.I.X.","date":". 09-14-2014, 01:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T00:06:07-07:00","id":256551,"title":"","content":"Anglebloom<br /> -a night blooming flower that after being effected only ever blooms in the presence of a spike in resonant aether. seen by demons that grow it as a way to warn them of coming angels even if only a minute in advance.<br /> -Each flower if made into a tea can give the ability to detect aether to one who could not otherwise for 8hrs(maybe less)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}